<%# Empty state.

    Airbnb reading: an empty state is friendly and tells you what to do next,
    rather than apologising. Icon is decorative (aria-hidden via lucide_icon's
    defaults) because the heading and body carry the meaning.

    Two sizes, and the distinction matters. Polaris, Stripe and Material all draw the
    same line:

      default - page or table level, where the emptiness IS the screen. Centred, a
                48px icon tile, py-12. It earns the room because there is nothing else
                on the page competing for it.
      compact - section level, inside a card that already has a title and siblings.
                One left-aligned line with a small icon, and no padding of its own, so
                the card's p-5 sets the spacing. A centred full-height state here makes
                a card with nothing to say the tallest thing on the screen.

    Locals:
      title   - short heading, sentence case
      body    - optional sentence explaining what will appear here
      icon    - optional Lucide icon name (default: inbox)
      compact - true for the section-level treatment
      action  - optional block for a call to action %>
<% icon = local_assigns.fetch(:icon, "inbox") %>

<%# See _page_header: check the yielded content, not block_given?. %>
<% action = yield %>

<% if local_assigns[:compact] %>
  <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
    <%= lucide_icon(icon, class: "mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500") %>

    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-900"><%= title %></p>

      <% if local_assigns[:body].present? %>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-slate-600"><%= body %></p>
      <% end %>

      <% if action.present? %>
        <div class="mt-3"><%= action %></div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-12 text-center">
    <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-100">
      <%= lucide_icon(icon, class: "h-6 w-6 text-slate-500") %>
    </div>

    <p class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900"><%= title %></p>

    <% if local_assigns[:body].present? %>
      <p class="mt-1 max-w-md text-sm text-slate-600"><%= body %></p>
    <% end %>

    <% if action.present? %>
      <div class="mt-4"><%= action %></div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
<% end %>
